#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:487
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining "
"|morpheus|-type Blueprints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:489
msgid "Library: Blueprints - ARM (Formerly Provisioning: Blueprints - ARM)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:490
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:496
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:502
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:508
#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:514
msgid "None, Provision, Full"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:491
msgid ""
"Determines access to ARM-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. The "
"\"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from ARM Blueprints"
" without the ability to create or edit them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:492
msgid ""
"The Blueprints page allows for the creation of pre-configured, multi-tier"
" application definitions which can be deployed via the Apps page. With "
"this permission the blueprint type of ARM is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:493
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining ARM "
"blueprints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:495
msgid ""
"Library: Blueprints - CloudFormation (Formerly Provisioning: Blueprints -"
" CloudFormation)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:497
msgid ""
"Determines access to CloudFormation-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| "
"page. The \"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from "
"CloudFormation Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:498
msgid ""
"The Blueprints page allows for the creation of pre-configured, multi-tier"
" application definitions which can be deployed via the Apps page. With "
"this permission the blueprint type of CloudFormation is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:499
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining "
"CloudFormation blueprints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:501
msgid "Library: Blueprints - Helm (Formerly Provisioning: Blueprints - Helm)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:503
msgid ""
"Determines access to Helm-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. The "
"\"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from Helm "
"Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:504
msgid ""
"The Blueprints page allows for the creation of pre-configured, multi-tier"
" application definitions which can be deployed via the Apps page. With "
"this permission the blueprint type of Helm is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:505
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining Helm "
"blueprints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:507
msgid ""
"Library: Blueprints - Kubernetes (Formerly Provisioning: Blueprints - "
"Kubernetes)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:509
msgid ""
"Determines access to Kubernetes-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. "
"The \"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from Kubernetes"
" Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:510
msgid ""
"The Blueprints page allows for the creation of pre-configured, multi-tier"
" application definitions which can be deployed via the Apps page. With "
"this permission the blueprint type of Kubernetes is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:511
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining "
"Kubernetes blueprints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:513
msgid ""
"Library: Blueprint - Terraform (Formerly Provisioning: Blueprints - "
"Terraform)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:515
msgid ""
"Determines access to Terraform-type Blueprints on the |LibBluApp| page. "
"The \"Provision\" permission allows for provisioning Apps from Terraform "
"Blueprints without the ability to create or edit them."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:516
msgid ""
"The Blueprints page allows for the creation of pre-configured, multi-tier"
" application definitions which can be deployed via the Apps page. With "
"this permission the blueprint type of Terraform is available."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:517
msgid ""
"This permission is recommended for those responsible for defining "
"Terraform blueprints."
msgstr ""

#: ../../administration/roles/role_permissions.rst:519
